  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1PE 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obulamu Obuggya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale nga Kristo bwe yabonyaabonyezebwa mu mubiri, nammwe mumalirire okubonaabona nga ye. Kubanga abonaabona mu mubiri aba takyafugibwa kibi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuva kaakano nga muli mu nsi muno, mugoberere ebyo Katonda by'ayagala, so si kugoberera kwegomba kwammwe okw'omubiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera ebyayita mwemaliranga mu kukola ebyo Abaamawanga bye beegombanga. Mwali mwemalidde mu bwenzi, mu kwegomba okubi, mu butamiivu, mu binyumu, mu bubaga obw'omwenge, ne mu kusinza bakatonda abalala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaakano abo abatakkiriza Katonda beewuunya era babavuma bwe balaba nga temukyabeegattako mu ebyo bye bakola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abo baliwoza mu maaso ga Katonda. Kubanga yeeteeseteese okulamula abalamu n'abafu ng'asinziira ku ebyo bye baakola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enjiri kyeyava ebuulirwa, n'abafu balyoke basalirwe omusango ng'abantu abalala bonna, kyokka babe balamu mu mwoyo nga Katonda bw'ali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okukozesa Obulungi Ebirabo Katonda by'Atuwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkomerero ya byonna eneetera okutuuka. Noolwekyo mwetegeke era mwegenderezenga, era bulijjo musabenga Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ekisingira ddala obukulu mwagalanenga ddala mu mazima, kubanga okwagalana kubikka ebibi bingi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musembezeganenga awatali kwemulugunya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli omu asaanidde okukozesa n'obwesigwa buli kirabo Katonda kye yamuwa olw'okugasa banne nabo balyoke bafune emikisa gya Katonda emingi gy'agaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayogera, ayogerenga ng'atumiddwa Katonda; ayamba, akikolenga n'amaanyi gonna Katonda g'amuwadde; mu byonna Katonda alyoke agulumizibwenga mu Yesu Kristo, alina ekitiibwa n'obuyinza emirembe n'emirembe. Amiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okubonyaabonyezebwa olw'Okuba Omukristaayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaagalwa, temwewuunya obulumi obw'amaanyi bwe bubatuukako ng'abatuukiddwako ekintu ekitali kya bulijjo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyokka musanyuke kubanga mugabanye ku kubonaabona kwa Kristo, mulyoke mujjule essanyu, ng'ekitiibwa kye kirabise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulina omukisa bwe muvumibwa olw'erinnya lya Kristo kubanga Omwoyo ow'ekitiibwa owa Katonda ali ku mmwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mmwe temusaana kubaamu mutemu, oba mubbi, oba omukozi w'ebibi, wadde eyeeyingiza mu by'abalala. Kubanga buli abonyaabonyezebwa olw'ebyo taliiko ky'agasibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye bw'abonyaabonyezebwa olw'okuba Omukristaayo aleme kukwatibwa nsonyi, wabula yeebazenga Katonda olw'okuba owa Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubanga ekiseera kituuse Katonda okulamula ng'atandikira mu nnyumba ya Katonda. Obanga okulamula kutandikidde ku ffe, kale kiriba kitya ku abo abajeemera Enjiri ya Katonda?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Era obanga kizibu omutuukirivu okulokolebwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "1PE 4:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kale aboonoonyi n'abatatya Katonda balikolebwa batya?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noolwekyo abo ababonaabona olw'okutuukiriza ekyo Katonda ky'ayagala, basaanidde okuwaayo obulamu bwabwe eri Katonda waabwe omwesigwa, bakole obulungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
